--- dace70f8 Start a request GPT-Live agreed to but never handed off
In a call GPT-Live said "I'm on that one too" for last month without handing it off, so it was folded into the next request. Words left unclaimed for 4 s that ask for something now become their own request; small talk stays with GPT-Live, and a late hand-off takes the request over instead of repeating it. GPT-Live is also told that agreeing to check something needs its own hand-off.

